					<li>Harvard Business School, Accenture, and Grads of Life. Dismissed by Degrees: How degree inflation is undermining U.S. competitiveness and hurting America's middle class (2017). <a href="https://www.hbs.edu/faculty/Pages/item.aspx?num=53502">Report</a>.</li>
					<li>Ando, Yoshiki; Dinlersoz, Emin; Greenwood, Jeremy; and Piazzesi, Ruben. Technifying Ventures. NBER Working Paper 33993, revised March 2026. The paper reports large employment gains after VC funding among a concentrated group of firms. <a href="https://www.nber.org/papers/w33993">NBER</a>.</li>
